# Android emulator defaults to http://10.0.2.2:3001; web uses this browser's hostname.
# Physical phone: use your computer's LAN IPv4 address. The phone must be on the same network.
# Submitted APK: replace with a deployed, public HTTPS API before building.
# This value is public and embedded in the app. NEVER put provider secrets here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
